        "text": "RepoNova 输出包含配置、图谱、报告、社区视图、搜索索引、节点概要与 outlines，且 .cache 被忽略。",
        "method": "reponova build 与 Git 追踪检查",
        "evidence": "reponova-out/build-manifest.json、git check-ignore",
        "requirement_ids": [
          "REQ-001",
