        ],
        "substitution": "forbidden",
        "critical": true,
        "status": "passed"
      },
      {
        "id": "ACC-004",
        "text": "git diff --check 无错误；暂存区仅含既有修复、README、RepoNova 配置和非缓存产物、SOP 派生文档与 .gitignore。",
        "method": "独立 Git 审查",
        "evidence": "git diff --cached --check 与 git diff --cached --name-status",
        "requirement_ids": [
